  Einsum **will** broadcast over axes covered by the ellipsis.

  >>> s = tf.random.normal(shape=[11, 1, 5, 3])
  >>> t = tf.random.normal(shape=[1, 7, 3, 2])
  >>> e =  tf.einsum('...ij,...jk->...ik', s, t)
  >>> print(e.shape)
  (11, 7, 5, 2)

