  matrix C.  The elements of C are given by:

  $$ C_{i,k} = \sum_j A_{i,j} B_{j,k} $$

  or

  ```
  C[i,k] = sum_j A[i,j] * B[j,k]
  ```

  The corresponding einsum `equation` is:

  ```
  ij,jk->ik
  ```

